<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><strong><font face="Verdana" size="2">Send Email to</font></strong><font size="2"><font face="Verdana">&nbsp;- Finance and CR dept</font></font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font size="2"><font face="Verdana"><br></font></font></div><p style="font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Verdana" size="2">Hi,</font></p><p style="font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Verdana" size="2"><br></font></p><p style="font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Verdana" size="2">Please find attached the free trial request for<br><br><u><font face="Verdana, Helvetica" size="2"></font></u></font></p><font face="Verdana" size="2"><u><font face="Verdana, Helvetica" size="2"></font></u><font face="Verdana, Helvetica" size="2"></font></font><p style="font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Verdana" size="2"><font face="Verdana, Helvetica" size="2"><u>Account Information:<br></u></font><strong>Account Name</strong>&nbsp;- {!Account.Name}<br><strong>Account ID</strong>&nbsp;- {!Account.AccountID__c}<br></font><font face="Verdana"><font size="2"><strong>Account Type</strong>&nbsp;- {!Account.Type}<br><strong>Account Industry</strong>&nbsp;- {!Account.Industry}<br><font face="Verdana" size="2"><strong>Address</strong>&nbsp;- {!Account.ShippingAddress}</font></font></font></p><p style="font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Verdana"><font size="2"><br></font></font></p><u style="font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"></u><p align="left" style="font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><u><font face="Verdana" size="2">User&nbsp;Contact Information:</font></u><br><font face="Verdana" size="2"><strong>Name</strong>&nbsp;- {!Contact.FirstName} {!Contact.LastName}<font size="3"><font size="2"><br></font></font><strong>Email</strong>&nbsp;- {!Contact.Email}<font size="3"><font size="2"><br></font></font><font size="2"><strong>Phone</strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<font size="3"><font size="2">{!Contact.Phone}</font></font></font></font></p><p align="left" style="font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Verdana" size="2"><br></font></p><p align="left" style="font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Verdana" size="2"><strong>Sales Rep Name</strong>&nbsp;- {!Account.Primary_Sales_Rep__c}<br><strong>Sales Rep Manager</strong>&nbsp;- {!Account.PrimarySalesRepManager__c}<br></font><font face="Verdana" size="2"><br>Special Instructions (if they apply):</font></p><p align="left" style="font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Verdana" size="2"><br></font></p><p style="font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Verdana" size="2">This has also been approved by my manager, enclosed is the email.</font></p><p style="font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Verdana" size="2"><br></font></p><p style="font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Verdana" size="2">Regards,<br>&lt;Enter Signature&gt;</font></p>]]></td>
